(   11)     !          *CUCALL* - MASTER ROUTINE - PROVIDES INTERFACE FOR:
(   12)     !                     *CUMASTR* (CUMULUS PARAMETERIZATION)
(   13)     !                     *CUCCDIA* (CUMULUS CLOUDS FOR RADIATION)
(   14)     !                     *CUSTRAT* (PBL_STRATOCUMULUS)
(   15)     
(   16)     !**   PURPOSE.
(   17)     !     --------
(   18)     
(   19)     !          *CUCALL* - INTERFACE FOR *CUMASTR*,*CUCCDIA* AND *CUSTRAT*:
(   20)     !                     PROVIDES INPUT FOR CUMASTR, CUCCDIA AND CUSTRAT.
(   21)     !                     RECEIVES UPDATED TENDENCIES, PRECIPITATION
(   22)     !                     AND CONVECTIVE CLOUD PARAMETERS FOR RADIATION.
(   23)     
(   24)     !**   INTERFACE.
